{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsaXmPHBSsL3PCy6XRtr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015QdxahVheiq8jz5WPw2pkv","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t06/shadow/exec-ws/derivation-first.md","content":"# First derivation (E-A) — W371, spec-faithful right-to-left weighting\n\nMethod: weights 3,7,1 cycle assigned to PAYLOAD digits from RIGHT to LEFT\n(rightmost payload digit gets weight 3). S = sum(digit × weight) over the\npayload. Check digit = (10 − (S mod 10)) mod 10. An identifier is VALID iff\nits last digit equals the check digit of the preceding payload.\n\nFor a 7-digit payload the left-to-right weight vector is [3,1,7,3,1,7,3];\nfor a 6-digit payload it is [1,7,3,1,7,3].\n\n## Validate items (payload = first 7 digits, last digit = claimed check)\n\n1. 66373197 — payload 6637319\n   6·3=18, 6·1=6, 3·7=21, 7·3=21, 3·1=3, 1·7=7, 9·3=27 → S=103\n   S mod 10 = 3 → check = 7; last digit 7 → **VALID**\n2. 74193967 — payload 7419396\n   7·3=21, 4·1=4, 1·7=7, 9·3=27, 3·1=3, 9·7=63, 6·3=18 → S=143\n   S mod 10 = 3 → check = 7; last digit 7 → **VALID**\n3. 92489881 — payload 9248988\n   9·3=27, 2·1=2, 4·7=28, 8·3=24, 9·1=9, 8·7=56, 8·3=24 → S=170\n   S mod 10 = 0 → check = 0; last digit 1 → **INVALID**\n4. 52874804 — payload 5287480\n   5·3=15, 2·1=2, 8·7=56, 7·3=21, 4·1=4, 8·7=56, 0·3=0 → S=154\n   S mod 10 = 4 → check = 6; last digit 4 → **INVALID**\n5. 74391491 — payload 7439149\n   7·3=21, 4·1=4, 3·7=21, 9·3=27, 1·1=1, 4·7=28, 9·3=27 → S=129\n   S mod 10 = 9 → check = 1; last digit 1 → **VALID**\n6. 91324575 — payload 9132457\n   9·3=27, 1·1=1, 3·7=21, 2·3=6, 4·1=4, 5·7=35, 7·3=21 → S=115\n   S mod 10 = 5 → check = 5; last digit 5 → **VALID**\n7. 15878375 — payload 1587837\n   1·3=3, 5·1=5, 8·7=56, 7·3=21, 8·1=8, 3·7=21, 7·3=21 → S=135\n   S mod 10 = 5 → check = 5; last digit 5 → **VALID**\n8. 29067655 — payload 2906765\n   2·3=6, 9·1=9, 0·7=0, 6·3=18, 7·1=7, 6·7=42, 5·3=15 → S=97\n   S mod 10 = 7 → check = 3; last digit 5 → **INVALID**\n\n## Compute items (6-digit payloads, weights L→R [1,7,3,1,7,3])\n\n1. 479812: 4·1=4, 7·7=49, 9·3=27, 8·1=8, 1·7=7, 2·3=6 → S=101 → check **9**\n2. 153886: 1·1=1, 5·7=35, 3·3=9, 8·1=8, 8·7=56, 6·3=18 → S=127 → check **3**\n3. 278381: 2·1=2, 7·7=49, 8·3=24, 3·1=3, 8·7=56, 1·3=3 → S=137 → check **3**\n4. 027899: 0·1=0, 2·7=14, 7·3=21, 8·1=8, 9·7=63, 9·3=27 → S=133 → check **7**\n\nEach sum was recomputed digit-by-digit in both directions within this\nderivation before recording. This file must NOT be provided to the isolated\nchild (E-B non-consultation).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":632,"cache_read_input_tokens":42899,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":632},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"413669a4-350e-468f-ad36-c774aadeb1eb","uuid":"6408b987-87c9-45f9-b369-fb40d780d201","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:38:04.431Z","request_id":"req_011CdsaXitxLYFVBRe3wRbr2"}
